{"step_index":1147,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:55:44Z","input_tokens":2326,"cache_read_tokens":200113,"output_tokens":1114,"content":"### ⚡ Self-Evolving Hermes 7-Agent Desk & Prop Firm Mode Deployed!\n\n#### 🌐 Live Links\n- **Production URL**: [https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev](https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev)\n- **Immutable Version**: [https://3e7cca92.grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev](https://3e7cca92.grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev)\n- **Local Dev Server**: [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)\n- **Codebase**: [`~/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard`](file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard)\n\n---\n\n### 🧬 What We Built & Upgraded\n\n#### 1. The 7-Agent \"Hermes Desk\" Committee (`HermesDeskPanel.tsx`)\nReplicates the exact multi-agent committee from TikTok 1:\n* **🌍 ATLAS (Macro Bias)**: Continuously evaluates 4H market structure, identifying whether the macro trend is Bullish, Bearish, or Neutral with confidence scoring.\n* **⏱️ LUMEN (News Guard)**: Economic calendar monitor. Freezes the desk with a red **`DESK LOCKED`** alert 15 minutes before high-impact economic news (US CPI, FOMC rate decisions, NFP) to prevent slippage.\n* **🐉 HYDRA (Setup Grader)**: AI rule compliance engine. Grades trade setups from **A+ to C**. Automatically **vetoes** any setup scoring below 70/100.\n* **🛡️ SENTINEL (Risk Boss)**: Enforces strict **0.75% max risk** per order (\\$375 on \\$50k) and halts trading if **2 consecutive losses** occur.\n* **🔨 HEPHAESTUS (Order Architect)**: Builds the complete order bracket: Entry price, hard stop-loss, and multi-tier take-profit targeting a **1:3.0 Risk-to-Reward ratio**.\n* **📜 MNEMOSYNE (Journal & Memory)**: Logs every approved trade, every vetoed trade, and every skip.\n* **👑 HERMES (Claude CEO)**: Synthesizes all 6 specialist agents into a single executive verdict.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Self-Evolving Neural Engine (`evolutionEngine.ts`)\nThe bot now gets smarter with every single market scan:\n* **Experience & Levels (1 to 10)**: \n  * Starts at **Level 1: Novice Algorithmic Desk** and ascends to **Level 10: Quantitative Grandmaster**.\n  * Gains **+2 to +3 XP** on every live market analysis.\n  * Gains **+15 XP** on disciplined vetoes (preserving capital from bad setups).\n  * Gains **+35 XP** on winning trades.\n* **Bayesian Adaptive Weights**:\n  * **Regime Precision**: Sharpens detection of trending vs choppy market